*    - FIRST CARD MUST HAVE AN 8 CHARACTER ACCOUNT NUMBER IN            04350000
*    COLUMNS 16-23. THIS ACCOUNT NUMBER WILL BE VALIDATED BY            04400000
*    SEARCHING A TABLE OF VALID ACCOUNT NUMBERS.                        04450000
