*    PARAMETERS IN THAT ORDER. THE VALUES OF THESE PARAMETERS           04550000
*    WILL BE COMPARED WITH MAXIMUM VALUES IN A TABLE USING AN           04600000
*    INDEX DERIVED FROM THE ACCT #.                                     04650000
*    IF THESE REQUIREMENTS ARE NOT SATISFIED, THE JOB IS CANCELED.      04700000
*    THIS MODULE ALSO GETS THE TIME OF DAY AT WHICH THE JOB IS          04750000
*    ENQUEUED AND PUTS IT IN THE USER COMMUNICATIONS AREA WHERE         04800000
*    IT WILL BE USED BY THE JOB INITIATION ROUTINE (IEFUJI).            04850000
* ENTRY POINTS -                                                        04900000
*         IEFUJV                                                        04950000
* INPUT                                                                 05000000
*    REGISTER 1 POINTS TO A LIST OF 4 BYTE ADDRESSES FOR THE            05050000
*    FOLLOWING THREE PARAMETERS:                                        05100000
