*    SYSTEM ID (4 BYTES)                                                05300000
*    USER ID (8 BYTES)                                                  05350000
*    USER COMMUNICATIONS AREA (4 BYTES)                                 05400000
*    ZERO FOR INITIAL ENTRY, FIRST BYTE IS USED AS A                    05450000
*    BRANCH CODE WHEN PROCESSING THE JOB CARD SEQUENCE.                 05500000
*    TIME OF DAY FOR JOB INITIATION ROUTINE IS PUT                      05550000
*    HERE WHEN THE JOB ENQUEUE ENTRY IS TAKEN.                          05600000
*    2 - 80 BYTES CONTAINING THE JCL STATEMENT IMAGE.                   05650000
*    3 - 1 BYTE ENTRY CODE WITH ONE OF THE FOLLOWING VALUES:            05700000
*    0 - NULL STATEMENT                                                 05750000
*    1 - JOB STATEMENT                                                  05800000
*    2 - EXEC STATEMENT                                                 05850000
*    4 - DD STATEMENT                                                   05900000
*    8 - PROC STATEMENT                                                 05950000
*    16 - JOB ENQUEUE (SECOND PARAMETER IS MEANINGLESS)                 06000000
* OUTPUT                                                                06050000
*    REGISTER 15 MUST CONTAIN ONE OF THE FOLLOWING RETURN CODES:        06100000
*    0 - CONTINUE PROCESSING                                            06150000
*    4 - CANCEL                                                         06200000
* EXTERNAL REFERENCES - NONE                                            06250000
* EXITS,NORMAL - RETURN TO CALLER                                       06300000
* EXITS,ERROR - NONE                                                    06350000
* TABLES/WORK AREAS -                                                   06400000
