*    TIMETBL - TAB OF VALID TIME SPECS                                  06550000
* ATTRIBUTES - STANDARD                                                 06600000
* CHARACTER CODE DEPENDENCY - NONE                                      06650000
* NOTES - GETMAIN FREEMAIN AND TIME MACROS USED                         06700000
*        EJECT                                                          06750000
